1
00:00:00,978 --> 00:00:04,278
(Sheldon:)But I'm sure those Cool Ranch
Doritos are doing the trick.

2
00:00:05,817 --> 00:00:07,087
(Scene:)Sheldon.

3
00:00:07,085 --> 00:00:08,715
(gasps)
Leonard!

4
00:00:08,719 --> 00:00:11,049
(Sheldon:)Oh, I'm so happy
to see you.

5
00:00:11,055 --> 00:00:13,125
(Leonard:)Are you okay?
Oh, I'm fine.

6
00:00:13,124 --> 00:00:14,854
(Sheldon:)Why did you come?

7
00:00:16,461 --> 00:00:18,091
(Amy:)What do you mean,
why did I come?

8
00:00:18,096 --> 00:00:19,226
(Amy:)You're my boyfriend.

9
00:00:19,230 --> 00:00:20,930
(Amy:)I haven't seen you
in over a month.

10
00:00:20,932 --> 00:00:22,932
(Amy:)I just drove six hours
to help you out.

11
00:00:22,934 --> 00:00:24,534
(Amy:)Don't you have
anything to say besides,

12
00:00:24,535 --> 00:00:25,605
"Why did you come?"

13
00:00:26,737 --> 00:00:28,537
(Sheldon:)I do, but...

14
00:00:28,539 --> 00:00:30,209
(Sheldon:)I feel uncomfortable
saying it out loud

15
00:00:30,208 --> 00:00:31,808
(Sheldon:)in front of these
police officers.

16
00:00:33,411 --> 00:00:34,441
(Leonard:)Fine.

17
00:00:34,445 --> 00:00:35,515
(Amy:)Whisper it.

18
00:00:40,384 --> 00:00:41,454
(Sheldon(whispers):)Shotgun.

19
00:00:49,527 --> 00:00:51,797
(Leonard:)So, Sheldon, tell
us about your trip.

20
00:00:51,796 --> 00:00:53,166
(Leonard:)Where'd you go?

21
00:00:53,164 --> 00:00:54,664
(Sheldon:)Where didn't I go?

22
00:00:54,665 --> 00:00:55,765
(Sheldon:)I went to New York,

23
00:00:55,766 --> 00:00:59,026
(Sheldon:)Chicago, Atlanta, Denver,

